  "worked_solution": "The coordinates of $B$ are $(1,4).$\n\n* Since the vertical line should pass through $(1,4)$, the $x$-value for every point on the line is $1.$ Hence, the equation of that line is \n\n$$\nx=1.\n$$\n\n* Since the horizontal line should pass through $(1,4)$, the $y$-value for every point on the line is $4.$ Hence, the equation of that line is \n\n$$\ny=4.\n$$",
